WEBVTT

00:06.910 --> 00:10.010
It's useless to try and find him myself...

00:10.480 --> 00:12.740
Maybe I'll ask the guild to 
send out search parties.

00:16.210 --> 00:17.790
<i>This knock...</i>

00:19.470 --> 00:22.550
<i>But why isn't he just coming in?</i>

00:28.190 --> 00:29.700
<i>Something must've happened.</i>

00:34.820 --> 00:39.330
<i>Well, as long as you're alive... 
that's all I care about.</i>

00:40.920 --> 00:42.550
Lorraine...

00:44.220 --> 00:46.720
Lorraine... wake up.

00:47.250 --> 00:49.100
I said wake up!

00:50.060 --> 00:52.820
Let me sleep just a little more...

00:53.470 --> 00:57.770
I'll drop a book on your head.

00:58.200 --> 01:02.620
Please don't do that...

01:07.770 --> 01:10.560
Rentt... What happened?

02:41.890 --> 02:46.020
As you know, I study monsters and magic.

02:42.390 --> 02:46.640
The Undead
Infiltrates the Town

02:46.020 --> 02:50.630
But I've never heard of anyone who got eaten 
by a dragon and turned into an undead.

02:50.630 --> 02:53.790
Is this "dragon" still in the labyrinth?

02:53.790 --> 02:56.440
I think it's gone...

02:57.180 --> 03:01.280
I'm not sure I believe a word 
of what you're saying...

03:01.280 --> 03:04.620
But I don't think I have a choice, 
given the way you look right now.

03:10.190 --> 03:13.890
<i>Even seeing me like this, 
she's completely calm.</i>

03:13.890 --> 03:18.450
<i>That's Lorraine for you. Academic, 
mage, and adventurer.</i>

03:19.040 --> 03:23.730
<i>Though it feels like she's viewing me as less 
of a friend and more of a test subject...</i>

03:23.730 --> 03:24.870
Rentt.

03:25.330 --> 03:28.670
I know this is a cruel thing 
to say, but are you...

03:30.010 --> 03:33.980
Are you, now that you're 
undead, really Rentt Faina?

03:38.460 --> 03:43.660
<i>I have the memories and mind of Rentt Faina.</i>

03:43.660 --> 03:46.640
<i>But I definitely died.</i>

03:47.960 --> 03:51.570
<i>Are the current me and the 
old me the same person?</i>

03:53.230 --> 03:54.900
I don't know.

03:54.900 --> 03:59.350
That answer seems like exactly 
what I'd expect Rentt to say.

03:59.350 --> 04:02.810
But it's hard to say if you're 
really the same person.

04:03.210 --> 04:07.410
But we'll set that problem aside for 
the moment. I'll think about it later.

04:07.920 --> 04:11.300
So, what will you do now?

04:12.160 --> 04:15.670
I want to continue being an adventurer.

04:16.710 --> 04:19.350
I'm going to become mythril, no matter what.

04:21.530 --> 04:25.900
But I can't go to the guild like this.

04:26.200 --> 04:30.050
So you want me to accept 
jobs for you, right?

04:30.050 --> 04:32.730
Oh, you can't use the inn either, can you?

04:32.730 --> 04:34.690
Stay here, then.

04:34.690 --> 04:36.190
I appreciate it, but...

04:36.860 --> 04:38.980
Are you sure?

04:38.980 --> 04:40.920
It doesn't bother me in the slightest.

04:40.920 --> 04:45.120
But I'm sure you'd feel awkward if 
I offered to let you stay for free.

04:46.600 --> 04:50.100
So instead, you can help with my research.

04:50.100 --> 04:53.810
No one's ever had the chance 
to study a monster that can

04:53.810 --> 04:55.680
use existential evolution directly.

04:55.680 --> 04:58.190
You can't dissect me or anything.

04:58.190 --> 05:00.930
What kind of monster do you take me for?

05:03.960 --> 05:07.460
Well, I might ask for some 
skin and flesh, though.

05:12.110 --> 05:14.240
Rentt, I'm back.

05:15.370 --> 05:16.840
Thanks.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.800
Here's the money for the magic stones.

05:18.800 --> 05:21.760
And this is the money for the slime liquid.

05:22.600 --> 05:24.680
You'll pay this much?

05:24.680 --> 05:29.300
If I pay you directly, I can 
cut out the guild's fee.

05:29.300 --> 05:33.130
And the materials you bring in 
are always of high quality.

05:33.450 --> 05:36.070
They make for great beauty lotions.

05:36.070 --> 05:38.240
Okay, thanks...

05:39.080 --> 05:41.830
I'm off to the Three-Pronged Spear.

05:42.110 --> 05:43.670
The blacksmith?

05:43.670 --> 05:44.640
Yeah.

05:48.650 --> 05:52.360
<i>Few things in life feel 
as nice as a heavy purse.</i>

06:04.240 --> 06:05.810
Welcome!

06:07.500 --> 06:11.310
Sorry I look so... strange.

06:11.310 --> 06:14.760
No, don't let it bother you at all.

06:14.760 --> 06:17.640
Come closer. May I ask what brings you here?

06:18.650 --> 06:21.770
I want a new sword.

06:21.770 --> 06:23.410
Let me take a look.

06:29.830 --> 06:32.550
It seems like you've been 
taking good care of it,

06:32.550 --> 06:35.030
but it's at the limit of its lifespan.

06:35.030 --> 06:39.420
From the look of the damage, I assume 
you either use magic or spirit energy?

06:39.420 --> 06:42.960
Yes, I use both.

06:43.530 --> 06:45.010
And divinity, too.

06:46.590 --> 06:50.540
All of them? That's very rare.

06:50.540 --> 06:53.750
You're only the second such 
person to ever visit our store.

06:54.060 --> 06:56.810
If you could keep it a secret...

06:56.810 --> 06:59.240
Of course!

06:59.240 --> 07:03.770
You can't be a blacksmith if you 
can't keep your customers' secrets.

07:05.110 --> 07:07.010
Will this be enough?

07:11.310 --> 07:14.320
Yes. We should be able to 
make something quite nice.

07:14.620 --> 07:16.870
Feel free to just pay half for the moment.

07:16.870 --> 07:19.520
You can pay the remainder 
when you pick it up.

07:19.520 --> 07:20.950
That would be wonderful.

07:21.200 --> 07:23.940
I'm afraid, however,
that the owner, Clope,

07:23.940 --> 07:26.540
takes a great deal of pride in his work.

07:27.640 --> 07:29.890
It will take several days to do the work,

07:29.890 --> 07:33.890
and he'll probably want to speak with you 
several times throughout the process.

07:34.840 --> 07:36.780
That's fine...

07:36.780 --> 07:42.260
When you want to see me, 
contact Lorraine, the academic.

07:45.760 --> 07:47.510
Very well.

07:48.910 --> 07:51.430
A ghoul... a lesser undead.

07:51.430 --> 07:55.840
Strong physical abilities, and capable 
of surviving even decapitation.

07:55.840 --> 07:58.790
They prefer the meat of 
animals, particularly humans.

07:59.280 --> 08:01.690
Mostly found in the labyrinths.

08:01.690 --> 08:05.630
Some theories say they are 
born from human corpses.

08:05.940 --> 08:11.080
There are known cases of powerful monsters 
turning humans into lesser undead.

08:11.080 --> 08:15.310
But in those cases, the victims not 
only lost their personalities,

08:15.310 --> 08:18.660
they lost any kind of 
human will or emotion...

08:21.840 --> 08:27.020
Rentt is an extremely special 
case. So I can't be sure, yet.

08:27.340 --> 08:33.480
But the chance that he's the exact same 
being he was in life is extremely low.

08:34.770 --> 08:36.060
But...

08:36.060 --> 08:38.900
He feels like Rentt to me.

08:40.390 --> 08:42.300
He's always...

08:47.000 --> 08:48.330
Missy!

08:49.960 --> 08:51.120
Yes?

08:51.510 --> 08:55.620
You just took a job that'll send 
you to Azul Forest, right?

08:55.620 --> 08:59.550
Take him with you as your pack bearer, then.

09:01.440 --> 09:06.670
Nah, you don't have to pay him. 
He's an iron-class. A rookie.

09:06.670 --> 09:08.990
I'd like you to help him 
gain some experience.

09:15.570 --> 09:18.120
The leaves look different...

09:18.120 --> 09:19.450
This isn't it, either.

09:20.950 --> 09:23.840
Maybe the texts were wrong.

09:25.780 --> 09:29.870
<i>The world was such a boring 
place to me back then.</i>

09:30.950 --> 09:34.390
<i>Even when I became the youngest person 
to ever attain the title of Great Doctor,</i>

09:34.390 --> 09:35.840
<i>it meant nothing to me.</i>

09:39.170 --> 09:43.980
<i>The title of Great Doctor allows one to 
register as a silver-class adventurer.</i>

09:44.630 --> 09:50.890
<i>I went to the frontier nation of Yarlan 
without saying a word to anyone around me.</i>

09:51.370 --> 09:54.910
<i>Ostensibly, I was there to 
gather some herbs I wanted.</i>

09:55.720 --> 09:58.810
<i>But in fact, I just had 
nothing better to do.</i>

10:02.030 --> 10:02.950
This is it!

10:03.470 --> 10:07.530
You need to harvest the root 
too, or it's less effective.

10:07.530 --> 10:09.130
I need to be careful...

10:17.510 --> 10:19.560
Hey, pack bearer!

10:20.300 --> 10:22.150
Put this in the pack for me!

10:31.520 --> 10:34.010
Hey, you can't just—

10:36.330 --> 10:38.590
How did you know how to harvest these?

10:49.350 --> 10:50.930
Use Fortia Polivus!

11:01.490 --> 11:02.930
Incredible...

11:03.300 --> 11:06.760
I guess a silver-rank has magic 
 on a whole other level...

11:06.760 --> 11:09.550
No, it's nothing special...

11:14.930 --> 11:15.780
Here.

11:16.820 --> 11:19.640
Was that your first battle?

11:19.640 --> 11:20.890
Of course not.

11:23.630 --> 11:28.340
But I always had lots of escorts, 
or at least people with me...

11:29.580 --> 11:31.180
Don't tell me you...

11:31.780 --> 11:35.090
You didn't seem very experienced 
for a silver-class.

11:35.580 --> 11:38.600
So everyone got worried and 
told me to follow you.

11:40.860 --> 11:42.380
I see...

11:43.410 --> 11:46.440
You know a lot about herbs, don't you?

11:46.820 --> 11:51.810
Someone once told me that if 
I wanted to be an adventurer,

11:51.810 --> 11:54.550
I should learn to read and write,

11:55.190 --> 11:58.770
and about plants, monsters, 
and anything else I could.

12:01.490 --> 12:04.430
Hey, I didn't get your name.

12:04.430 --> 12:07.240
Oh, I'm Rentt.

12:07.700 --> 12:09.200
Rentt Faina.

12:10.050 --> 12:11.930
Lorraine Vivie.

12:11.930 --> 12:14.540
Nice to meet you, Lorraine.

12:15.610 --> 12:16.550
Hey...

12:17.930 --> 12:20.640
Could you teach me, too?

12:22.160 --> 12:25.860
About herbs, and how to fight...

12:25.860 --> 12:29.180
You knew exactly how to move 
through the forest, too.

12:29.180 --> 12:30.970
There's some trick to it, right?

12:31.990 --> 12:34.260
Well, I don't mind...

12:35.230 --> 12:38.520
There's so much I want to know!

12:39.910 --> 12:43.820
<i>That's how things began
between me and Rentt.</i>

12:44.290 --> 12:49.440
<i>He kept working hard every single 
day for the next 10 years,</i>

12:49.440 --> 12:51.360
<i>aiming to become mythril-class.</i>

12:51.760 --> 12:56.350
<i>And I stayed by his side, 
doing the research I loved.</i>

12:56.800 --> 12:57.970
<i>That was all I wanted.</i>

12:58.320 --> 13:01.540
<i>Well, I did change, a little.</i>

13:02.230 --> 13:06.910
<i>I can see, looking back, why the 
adults were worried about me.</i>

13:08.230 --> 13:12.170
I just realized I've been 
lax about replying to letters.

13:12.170 --> 13:14.640
I don't want another 
lecture from the old men.

13:18.950 --> 13:22.450
I'll have to ask Rentt where I put them...

13:24.110 --> 13:27.450
Thanks for making a new sword for me.

13:27.760 --> 13:30.570
Yeah, I'll make sure it's something special.

13:36.670 --> 13:37.970
Thanks.

13:40.580 --> 13:44.340
Use this until your sword is ready.

13:47.130 --> 13:49.620
It can use magic and spirit energy.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.120
Nothing else.

13:52.330 --> 13:53.530
Got it.

13:59.790 --> 14:02.890
Looks like he's in a good bit of trouble.

14:03.680 --> 14:06.580
Why doesn't he come to us for help?

14:06.580 --> 14:09.200
Are we that untrustworthy?

14:09.640 --> 14:13.940
I'm guessing that's a curse 
he's suffering from.

14:14.510 --> 14:19.420
It's probably a nasty one. One 
he thinks might affect our shop.

14:19.420 --> 14:20.870
How awful...

14:20.870 --> 14:23.440
He doesn't like to cause 
trouble for other people.

14:23.440 --> 14:27.370
But still, he said some things that 
would help us realize who he is, right?

14:27.800 --> 14:31.240
He did. That he could use all types of power,

14:31.240 --> 14:33.510
and that he was staying with Lorraine.

14:33.890 --> 14:34.970
Right?

14:34.970 --> 14:37.760
We can make him tell us 
the truth eventually.

14:38.120 --> 14:41.840
It does look like he's going 
to keep coming to our shop.

14:42.910 --> 14:43.740
Yes.

14:46.180 --> 14:46.950
It's delicious!

14:47.420 --> 14:49.770
It's been too long since 
you've cooked for me!

14:49.770 --> 14:51.770
There's more if you want it.

14:52.190 --> 14:53.010
Sure.

14:54.420 --> 14:56.500
You're not eating?

14:56.500 --> 14:58.700
I don't get hungry.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.340
I see...

15:01.000 --> 15:02.330
Good, then.

15:03.370 --> 15:09.340
Rentt, while you were out, I 
read over all my books again.

15:09.750 --> 15:13.220
It's clear that you're different 
from an ordinary ghoul.

15:13.220 --> 15:17.750
That's probably got something to do with 
the reason you can existential evolve...

15:18.660 --> 15:21.520
What will you become next?

15:23.270 --> 15:24.850
I don't know.

15:25.310 --> 15:29.430
But I want to be as close to human as I can.

15:29.430 --> 15:31.270
I guess that's the first step.

15:31.270 --> 15:36.000
And for that, I'll aim for my 
next existential evolution.

15:36.000 --> 15:38.950
Then it's back to the 
labyrinth for a while.

15:38.950 --> 15:42.920
Yeah. I'll defeat monsters and get stronger.

15:45.730 --> 15:50.130
No, I was just thinking that 
you really don't change.

15:56.970 --> 15:58.470
Damn it!

16:12.180 --> 16:13.730
You okay?

16:14.960 --> 16:16.650
Y-Yeah!

16:17.560 --> 16:20.570
Thanks, you saved my life.

16:20.570 --> 16:23.990
I didn't expect a slime 
to attack like that...

16:24.940 --> 16:29.810
I got a little cut. It's 
nothing bad, though.

16:30.620 --> 16:31.540
Hey!

16:31.810 --> 16:34.830
<i>Adventurers are expected to be 
responsible for themselves.</i>

16:35.420 --> 16:37.880
<i>If you die in the labyrinth, it's 
your fault, no matter what.</i>

16:38.540 --> 16:41.850
<i>No one is obligated to help 
an adventurer in a bad spot.</i>

16:39.790 --> 16:41.610
Hey, wait!

16:42.340 --> 16:43.990
<i>There are even awful people out there</i>

16:43.990 --> 16:48.290
<i>who'll pretend to be in trouble and rob 
adventurers who come to help them,</i>

16:48.290 --> 16:49.580
<i>though they're rare in Maalt.</i>

16:49.580 --> 16:51.360
You're strong, aren't I?

16:50.450 --> 16:54.170
<i>I still always try to save 
as many as I can, but...</i>

16:54.610 --> 16:57.330
Please! Let me join your party!

16:59.320 --> 17:01.820
I need... I need the money.

17:02.120 --> 17:06.250
As you can see, I just 
registered as an adventurer.

17:06.250 --> 17:08.990
I can't even fight a slime!

17:08.990 --> 17:11.040
Slimes are strong.

17:11.040 --> 17:12.980
Th-They are?

17:12.980 --> 17:14.920
They're hard for swordsmen to fight.

17:14.920 --> 17:17.670
So you are a veteran, aren't you?

17:18.750 --> 17:22.970
I'm a chef. I've got a restaurant in Maalt.

17:22.970 --> 17:28.680
But I'm badly in debt, and I need 
to repay 15 gold by next week.

17:28.910 --> 17:32.640
I figured I've got no choice but to take 
a chance and become an adventurer.

17:32.640 --> 17:37.080
I told everybody that I'd do whatever they 
wanted, as long as they let me in their party.

17:37.080 --> 17:39.950
But nobody would give me a chance.

17:39.950 --> 17:43.830
So I came here, since they said you 
could go into this labyrinth alone.

17:43.830 --> 17:48.650
<i>That's only if you're 
actually kind of strong...</i>

17:49.610 --> 17:53.380
Sorry, but I'm busy.

17:57.110 --> 18:02.970
<i>I'd love to help him, but unless he got 
really lucky and found a magic item...</i>

18:04.640 --> 18:05.720
Wait.

18:07.940 --> 18:08.880
Hey.

18:09.860 --> 18:11.940
You can come with me after all.

18:11.940 --> 18:14.610
I assume you can at least carry a pack.

18:15.950 --> 18:18.110
Wait! You're sure?

18:18.110 --> 18:19.000
Yeah.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.990
Hooray!

18:21.580 --> 18:25.070
<i>I don't know if he's a good guy or not,</i>

18:25.070 --> 18:27.750
<i>but it won't hurt to try 
and help someone out.</i>

18:27.750 --> 18:31.300
I'm pretty strong, you know. 
I'll do whatever you need.

18:33.880 --> 18:37.350
<i>Sometimes I get really scared...</i>

18:37.350 --> 18:38.800
<i>Am I really me?</i>

18:39.900 --> 18:43.970
Are you, now that you're 
undead, really Rentt Faina?

18:45.250 --> 18:47.350
This isn't good...

18:54.140 --> 18:57.110
Hey, this is a dead end, right?

18:57.640 --> 18:59.830
Just follow me.

19:07.330 --> 19:09.740
Huh? There's a corridor.

19:09.740 --> 19:12.340
The map says it's a dead end.

19:12.340 --> 19:13.520
Let's go.

19:21.560 --> 19:23.030
You're kidding me...

19:23.500 --> 19:27.760
There's a place like this down here in 
the Labyrinth of the Moon's Reflection?

19:28.640 --> 19:30.550
<i>No dragon, huh?</i>

19:46.590 --> 19:50.380
<i>I figured there'd be a 
magic item or two, but...</i>

19:50.380 --> 19:55.330
Hey, I found a little gap over here!

19:58.200 --> 20:00.430
A hidden passage?

20:00.430 --> 20:05.470
Hey, wouldn't we make a fortune 
if we told the guild about this?

20:06.840 --> 20:11.590
N-No, I mean, of course I know 
you're the one who found it!

20:11.590 --> 20:13.680
I just followed you here.

20:14.020 --> 20:17.410
There's no way I could take the credit.

20:18.870 --> 20:21.860
I'm not interested in glory.

20:22.170 --> 20:24.730
Tell everyone you found it.

20:25.440 --> 20:28.690
But come on ahead with me.

20:38.720 --> 20:41.980
Damn it! Another empty room?

20:42.550 --> 20:44.420
Let's look for secret passages.

20:44.420 --> 20:48.640
Nobody's come here. There should 
be at least a treasure or two.

20:45.210 --> 20:46.260
Wait!

20:53.120 --> 20:53.980
Hey!

20:53.980 --> 20:55.710
It's fine!

20:55.710 --> 20:57.730
There are no monsters here or anything.

20:58.750 --> 21:00.170
<i>He can't see it?</i>

21:00.860 --> 21:01.910
Stop!

21:05.220 --> 21:06.870
No...

21:08.020 --> 21:09.750
A teleportation circle...?

21:10.360 --> 21:14.580
<i>Step on a teleportation circle and 
you'll be sent somewhere else.</i>

21:14.580 --> 21:17.850
<i>Usually a lower floor filled 
with strong monsters,</i>

21:17.850 --> 21:19.960
<i>or some place with deadly traps...</i>

21:21.100 --> 21:24.180
<i>The smart thing to do 
would be to abandon him,</i>

21:24.180 --> 21:26.850
<i>but if I do that, I'm just 
a monster, aren't I?</i>

21:27.290 --> 21:28.610
Damn it...

21:39.590 --> 21:40.590
Hey!

21:47.820 --> 21:50.990
A giant... skeleton...

21:52.480 --> 21:54.420
A boss room, huh?

23:35.640 --> 23:39.970
Existential Evolution
